            "title2": "",
            "show_contact": false,
            "text": "",
            "richtext": "",
            "list_items": "Must be at least 18 years old and a US resident (19 years old in Alabama or if you're a ward of the state in Nebraska);\nNot available to residents of Vermont, New Jersey, Wisconsin, Iowa, and West Virginia ;\nThere is an application fee of $9.99 for approved loans with PayTomorrow;\nIf the customer elects finance through PayTomorrow's UOWN, there is a $40 fee to be paid at the time of signing the agreement;\nLoanable amounts, payment amounts, and lengths depend on the creditworthiness of the respective consumer, maximum of $10,000 loanable amount;\nFinal approval of a loan may take anywhere from 24 hours to a few days;\nThe first payment will be due no sooner than 15 days after PayTomorrow pays a merchant on your behalf. Final schedule will be discussed before you select your offer;\nPayment methods accepted are debit card and ACH transfers only;\nAPR will depend on the amount approved and months eligible given to the customer. PayTomorrow will provide you with the details for your review, prior to agreeing to the terms and conditions.",
