            "richtext": "",
            "list_items": "Fill up the <a id=\"paytomorrow-link\" href=\"#\">\n   Fitness Superstore PayTomorrow Pre-approval Form\n</a>;\nWait for an approval decision;\nOnce approved, call Fitness Superstore at (925) 215-2927 or email <a href=\"mailto:sales.cs@FitnessSuperstore.com\">sales.cs@FitnessSuperstore.com</a> with a screenshot of your cart ;\nWe will confirm that we have received your information and add your items to your PayTomorrow application;\nPayTomorrow will send you a link via SMS/email to approve and finalize your order. Sign the agreements so we can start preparing your shipment!",
